## Conclusion

The Retail Sales Analysis project successfully analyzed sales, profit, regional performance, category performance, product performance, and sales trends using the Superstore dataset. Pandas, NumPy, and Matplotlib were used for data cleaning, statistical analysis, grouping, filtering, sorting, and visualization. The insights obtained can help businesses improve sales strategies, profitability, inventory planning, and data-driven decision-making.
